			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Split monolithic Message and WorkspaceNamespace into modular directories\n\nReorganize the Cocoon extension host's IPC messaging and workspace namespace implementations from large monolithic files into smaller, focused modules within dedicated directories.\n\n- Split Source/IPC/Message.ts into Message/ directory with separate modules for Types, Constants, VSBuffer, Validation, Serialization, Deserialization, Batching, and Utilities\n- Split Source/Services/Handler/VscodeAPI/WorkspaceNamespace.ts into WorkspaceNamespace/ directory with Configuration, FileSystemNamespace, FileSystemWatcher, FindFiles, Helpers, Providers, and TextDocument modules\n- Add new Window service modules (FileDialogs, Interfaces, OutputChannel, QuickInput, StatusBar) and ModuleInterceptor/Types\n- Maintain backward compatibility via barrel re-export files (Index.ts) so existing import paths continue to work\n\nThis refactoring improves maintainability and enables independent evolution of each subsystem.",
			"SHA": "91b490069b9039783ce7fde9058e749e1113b7e4"
